{
  "about": "Add a deck or cube to the collection (contract/list-to-collection-2026-10-22.md). Each line goes in as the printing and finish the list names. Main and Commander always count; a deck's sideboard counts unless sideboard is false; Considering never does. 'missing' adds only what the collection lacks of each printing + finish (owned is keyed 'card_id|finish', every condition and language); 'all' adds every copy listed. 'only' limits it to some printings (card detail). Ops come out sorted by card_id, then finish, and only with delta > 0. iOS ListToCollectionTests, web listToCollection.test.ts and Android ListToCollectionTest read this.",
